    {"file":"packages/foundation/modeling/yaml/src/internal/rules/colon-spacing.ts","symbol":"colonSpacingOptions","kind":"struct-const","owner":"@beep/yaml","identity":"colonSpacingOptions","description":"Options for `colon-spacing`: `maxSpacesBefore` (default 0) and `maxSpacesAfter` (default 1) around the `:` indicator. `maxSpacesBefore: 0` is legal (`key:` needs no space before the colon), but at least one separation space must FOLLOW it — `0` would make the fix emit `a:val`, a plain scalar, not a mapping entry."},
